            },
            "note": {
              "213": [
                "At the General Assessment of Real Estate in 1996, a new unit for one- or two-dwelling buildings was introduced: namely a one- or two-dwelling building, site with building, value of building of less than 50 000 SEK. \r\nSince 1996, these units have not been given any building value. This has resulted in some one- or two-dwelling buildings with a value of less than 50 000 SEK that in 1995 had type coding 220 or 221 but that, in 1996, were changed to type coding 213. The majority of units with type coding 213 had type coding 221 in 1995."
              ]
            }
